    "detailed_description": "This game recorded my school life, the second time I made the game, it was not very good. Playing this game, you will experience Guo Zhiyuan's helplessness in doing all kinds of bizarre behaviors, the last roar of a depressed patient, the player interacts with objects or people by walking around, thereby promoting the development of the plot, this game can be said to be a galgame without love elements, or it can be said that a junior high school student recalls his school life boring work. This game has many built-in mini-games, so that everyone will not be so bored when playing, such as finding an examination room, writing essays and so on.<br />\r\nOperating instructions:<br />\r\nWASD mobile<br />\r\nR interaction (this key can be pressed when a red exclamation mark appears above the character's head) / Get up from the chair<br />\r\nPress R to interact<br />\r\nZ Continue Conversation/Skip Video/Turn off Right Shift setting<br />\r\nHOME Archive (silent)<br />\r\nRight SHIFT settings",
